    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the general municipal law, in relation to making technical corrections thereto; and to repeal certain provisions of such law relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S5647",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5647-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
